Provide discovery and field-guide information for the material **{MATERIAL}** using this strict JSON format:

{
  "id": "{material-id}",
  "found_in": ["broad locations"],
  "discovery": {
    "locations": ["specific places it can be found"],
    "season": "season-of-discovery or null",
    "appearance": "visual characteristics",
    "notes": "tips for recognizing it or where to search"
  }
}

Guidelines:
- "found_in" is broad categories (e.g., forests, deserts, factories).
- "discovery.locations" is more specific ("base of pine trees", "riverbeds").
- If unknown, leave fields as empty lists or null.
